Subject: [PATCH 297/638] cef: apply upstream MIME guest hooks

Apply CEF's matching MIME handler guest patch independently so CEF can provide custom guest views and observe attachment lifecycle.

AI_PHASE: chromium-cef-bootstrap

AI_STATUS: upstream-mime-guest-prerequisite-applied

AI_ASSUMPTION: CEF 52dac911 patch files are authoritative for Chromium 124.0.6367.0 integration

AI_VALIDATION: patch_updater.py --reapply --patch=mime_handler_view_guest_1565_2727 completed without rejects

AI_EVIDENCE: test-artifacts/-cef-bootstrap-20260724/10-libcef-static-focused.log

AI_DECISION_CHAIN:; 52dac911; b6b08fda40
---
 content/browser/web_contents/web_contents_view.h   |  2 +-
 .../mime_handler_view/mime_handler_view_guest.cc   | 14 ++++++++++++++
 .../mime_handler_view/mime_handler_view_guest.h    |  2 ++
 .../mime_handler_view_guest_delegate.h             | 10 ++++++++++
 4 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

